 *   - OpenAI:                Set LLM_PROVIDER='openai', LLM_API_KEY to your OpenAI API key.
 *   - OpenAI OAuth:          Set LLM_PROVIDER='openai-oauth', LLM_API_KEY to your OpenAI OAuth token.
 *   - MiniMax:               Set LLM_PROVIDER='minimax', LLM_API_KEY to your MiniMax API key.
 *   - Gemini (default):      Set LLM_PROVIDER='gemini', LLM_API_KEY to your Gemini API key.
 *
 * For Ollama and LM Studio, no API key is needed.
 */
return [
